":"fo3-radroach","name":"Radroach","page":"Radroach (Fallout 3)","img":"img/creatures/fo3-radroach.webp","w":360,"h":203,"level":1,"speed":"normal","body":"arthropod","hp":5,"dmg":3,"derived":["level","speed"]},{"id":"fo3-radscorpion","name":"Radscorpion","page":"Radscorpion (Fallout 3)","img":"img/creatures/fo3-radscorpion.webp","w":360,"h":313,"level":6,"speed":"normal","body":"arthropod","hp":150,"dmg":22,"weak":{"head":1.0,"legs":0.4},"because":"No weak point (head x1.0) and much reduced damage on the legs (x0.4).","notes":[{"en":"Unlike other creatures, radscorpions lack a \"weak point\" that can be targeted for extra damage (such as a \"head\" for a headshot), which makes V.A.T.S. combat and firearms somewhat less effective against them.","it":"A differenza di altre creature, i radscorpion non hanno un «punto debole» da colpire per fare danno extra (come la «testa» per un colpo alla testa): per questo lo S.P.A.V. e le armi da fuoco sono meno efficaci contro di loro."},{"en":"Radscorpions also take significantly reduced damage from any shots that hit their legs, meaning that even a Critical Hit from a high-powered weapon will only do minor damage.","it":"I radscorpion subiscono inoltre un danno molto ridotto dai colpi alle zampe: anche un colpo critico di un'arma potente fa solo un danno minimo."}],"derived":["speed"]},{"id":"fo3-super_mutant","name":"Super mutant","page":"Super mutant (Fallout 3)","img":"img/creatures/fo3-super_mutant.webp","w":190,"h":360,"level":6,"speed":"normal","body":"humanoid","hp":100,"dmg":4,"derived":["speed"]},{"id":"fo3-yao_guai","name":"Yao guai","page":"Yao guai (Fallout 3)","img":"img/creatures/fo3-yao_guai.webp","w":357,"h":360,"level":7,"speed":"fast","body":"beast","hp":220,"dmg":75,"notes":[{"en":"Like all creatures with pounce attacks, the yao guai cannot pounce with a crippled hind leg.","it":"Come tutte le creature con attacco a balzo, lo yao guai non può balzare con una zampa posteriore storpiata."},{"en":"However, even 